"GraphyMcGraphFace"
gap> GraphvizGraph(666);
<graphviz graph "666" with 0 nodes and 0 edges>
gap> gv := GraphvizGraph();
<graphviz graph with 0 nodes and 0 edges>
gap> GraphvizName(gv);
""

# gap/dot.gd:258-269
